 "is_vocab": false,
 "stimulus_html": "Determine the percent markup based on the given cost and retail price. Round percentages to two decimal places.",
 "questions": [
  {
   "id": 516636,
   "is_answer_order_important": false,
   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "Cost = $120.00; retail price = $190.00",
   "answers": [],
   "hints": [],
   "formats": [
    "free-response"
   ],
   "combo_choices": [],
   "collaborator_solutions": [
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "summary",
     "content_html": "<p>retail price = cost + markup</p>\n<p>190 = 120 + markup</p>\n<p>70 = markup</p>\n<p>The markup is what percent of cost?</p>\n<p>70 is what percent of 120?</p>\n<p>70 = percent markup × 120</p>\n<p><span data-math=\"\\frac{{70}}{{120}}\"></span> = percent markup</p>\n<p>0.5833 ≈ percent markup</p>\n<p>58.33% ≈ percent markup</p>"
    },
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "detailed",
     "content_html": "58.33%"
    }
   ],
   "community_solutions": []
  },
  {
   "id": 516637,
   "is_answer_order_important": false,
   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "Cost = $0.38; retail price = $1.14",
   "answers": [],
   "hints": [],
   "formats": [
    "free-response"
   ],
   "combo_choices": [],
   "collaborator_solutions": [
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "summary",
     "content_html": "<p>retail price = cost + markup</p>\n<p>1.14 = 0.38 + markup</p>\n<p>0.76 = markup</p>\n<p>The markup is what percent of cost?</p>\n<p>0.76 is what percent of 0.38?</p>\n<p>0.76 = percent markup × 0.38</p>\n<p><span data-math=\"\\frac{{0.76}}{{0.38}}\"></span> = percent markup</p>\n<p>2 = percent markup</p>\n<p>200% = percent markup</p>"
    },
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "detailed",
     "content_html": "200%"
    }
   ],
   "community_solutions": []
  }
 ],
